{"seq":2,"slug":"fuzzy-match-transliteration-alias","title":"模糊匹配、音译与别名算法与阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/party-sanctions-screening-aml/screening-engine/fuzzy-match-transliteration-alias","wordCount":2801,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"模糊匹配-音译与别名算法与阈值\">模糊匹配、音译与别名算法与阈值</h1><p>主体筛查的技术难点不在于&quot;能不能比字符串&quot;，而在于<strong>同一个人名在不同语言系统里会变成完全不同的拉丁字符串</strong>。一个俄语名字经英语转写是 &quot;Yevgeny&quot;，经德语转写可能是 &quot;Jewgeni&quot;，经法语转写是 &quot;Evgueni&quot;，而名单上写的可能是 &quot;EVGENII&quot;。逐字符比较的算法在这四个字符串之间给出的相似度低到无法命中。这一篇拆解主体匹配的三层机制——预处理规范化、相似度打分、多字段融合——以及阈值标定这个决定了整个系统经济性的环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-匹配问题的三个层次\">核心概念：匹配问题的三个层次</h2><p>主体匹配要解三类不同性质的差异：<strong>文本形态差异</strong>（大小写、重音、标点、词序、缩写，有确定性规则可解）、<strong>语言转写差异</strong>（同一非拉丁语源的名字经不同转写体系进入拉丁字母，它不是错误而是多套并存的合法标准）、以及<strong>数据缺失与错误</strong>（生日只有年份、缺中间名、名单本身录入错误）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>处理手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本形态</td>\n<td>&quot;Smith, John&quot; / &quot;John Smith&quot;；Ltd / Limited</td>\n<td>确定性规范化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言转写</td>\n<td>Yevgeny / Jewgeni / EVGENII</td>\n<td>转写体系映射 + 语音编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据缺失与错误</td>\n<td>生日缺日、拼写录入错误</td>\n<td>多字段融合 + 容错打分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类差异要求三种手段，塞进一个编辑距离函数行不通。正确的架构是一条流水线：规范化先消掉第一类，转写与语音编码处理第二类，只有在这之后相似度算法才在剩下的空间里工作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始名称] --&gt; B[规范化: 大小写/标点/词序]&#10;  B --&gt; C[实体词剥离: Ltd/Inc/Co]&#10;  C --&gt; D{是否拉丁字母?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[转写/音译 → 拉丁形式]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[语音编码: Soundex/Metaphone]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[生成候选集: 倒排索引 + n-gram]&#10;  G --&gt; H[相似度打分: Jaro-Winkler / Levenshtein / Token]&#10;  H --&gt; I[多字段融合: 名称+国籍+生日+地址]&#10;  I --&gt; J{加权总分 ≥ 阈值?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[产出告警]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[判定未命中]\">graph TD\n  A[原始名称] --&gt; B[规范化: 大小写/标点/词序]\n  B --&gt; C[实体词剥离: Ltd/Inc/Co]\n  C --&gt; D{是否拉丁字母?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[转写/音译 → 拉丁形式]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[语音编码: Soundex/Metaphone]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[生成候选集: 倒排索引 + n-gram]\n  G --&gt; H[相似度打分: Jaro-Winkler / Levenshtein / Token]\n  H --&gt; I[多字段融合: 名称+国籍+生日+地址]\n  I --&gt; J{加权总分 ≥ 阈值?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[产出告警]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[判定未命中]</pre><h3 id=\"规范化-确定性消歧\">规范化：确定性消歧</h3><p>规范化是唯一可以完全确定的一层，因此应当做足：统一大小写、剥离变音符号（é → e）但保留原始形式以备回溯、统一标点与空白、把 &quot;姓, 名&quot; 重排为 &quot;名 姓&quot;、剥离公司实体后缀。实体后缀表需要多语言覆盖——同一家公司在不同名单里可能写作 Ltd、Limited、GmbH、S.A.、Pte Ltd、Co., Ltd。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"ENTITY_SUFFIXES = {&quot;LTD&quot;,&quot;LIMITED&quot;,&quot;INC&quot;,&quot;GMBH&quot;,&quot;SA&quot;,&quot;SAS&quot;,&quot;BV&quot;,&quot;NV&quot;,&quot;PTE&quot;,&#10;                   &quot;PTY&quot;,&quot;CO&quot;,&quot;CORP&quot;,&quot;LLC&quot;,&quot;OOO&quot;,&quot;PAO&quot;,&quot;AO&quot;}&#10;&#10;def normalize_name(raw: str, locale: str) -&gt; list[str]:&#10;    s = unicodedata.normalize(&quot;NFKD&quot;, raw)&#10;    s = &quot;&quot;.join(c for c in s if not unicodedata.combining(c))   # 剥离变音符号&#10;    s = re.sub(r&quot;[^\\w\\s]&quot;, &quot; &quot;, s).upper()&#10;    tokens = [t for t in s.split() if t]&#10;    if &quot;,&quot; in raw:                                              # &quot;姓, 名&quot; → &quot;名 姓&quot;&#10;        head, _, tail = raw.partition(&quot;,&quot;)&#10;        tokens = (tail.split() + head.split())&#10;        tokens = [re.sub(r&quot;[^\\w]&quot;, &quot; &quot;, t).upper() for t in tokens]&#10;    core = [t for t in tokens if t not in ENTITY_SUFFIXES]&#10;    return [&quot; &quot;.join(tokens), &quot; &quot;.join(core)]                   # 两个变体都进索引\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ENTITY_SUFFIXES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LTD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LIMITED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GMBH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SAS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BV\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NV\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PTE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                   \"PTY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CORP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LLC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OOO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PAO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> normalize_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(raw: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, locale: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unicodedata.normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NFKD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, raw)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unicodedata.combining(c))   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 剥离变音符号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re.sub(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w\\s]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, s).upper()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.split() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \",\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw:                                              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># \"姓, 名\" → \"名 姓\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        head, _, tail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw.partition(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\",\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tail.split() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.split())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [re.sub(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, t).upper() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    core </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ENTITY_SUFFIXES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(tokens), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(core)]                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 两个变体都进索引</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回两个变体是刻意的：带后缀的完整形式用于精确匹配，剥离后缀的核心形式用于与别名比较——因为名单条目与客户档案在是否带后缀上往往不一致。</p>\n<p>语音编码把名字映射成&quot;发音指纹&quot;，发音相同或相近的名字映射到同一编码。Soundex 是最经典的方案，Metaphone 及其改进版更常用，因为 Soundex 对非英语名字的近似能力有限。它的价值在<strong>召回的兜底</strong>：捕获拼写差异大但发音接近的名字（&quot;Catherine&quot;/&quot;Kathryn&quot;），这是编辑距离做不到的。代价是误报显著上升，因此它只用于<strong>生成候选集</strong>，不用于直接判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相似度算法-各自解决什么\">相似度算法：各自解决什么</h2><p>候选集生成后，需要用相似度打分来排序与截断。三种算法的适用面差异很大，混用会同时损失召回与精确。</p>\n<h3 id=\"jaro-winkler-前缀加权的编辑距离\">Jaro-Winkler：前缀加权的编辑距离</h3><p>Jaro 相似度基于匹配字符数与换位数计算：设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为匹配字符数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为换位数的一半，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sim_j = \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{m}{|s_1|} + \\frac{m}{|s_2|} + \\frac{m-t}{m}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>字符视为匹配的条件是字符相同且位置差不超过窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor \\max(|s_1|,|s_2|)/2 \\rfloor - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。Winkler 在此基础上加入<strong>前缀奖励</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sim_w = sim_j + \\ell p (1 - sim_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 是公共前缀长度（上限 4），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是前缀缩放因子，Winkler 给出的标准值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>，且不应超过 0.25，否则相似度可能超过 1（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaro%E2%80%93Winkler_distance\">Jaro–Winkler distance</a>）。</p>\n<p>前缀奖励对姓名匹配特别有价值：它给&quot;开头相同&quot;的字符串更高的分，而姓氏与名字的开头恰是最不容易被转写搞乱的部分。Jaro-Winkler 起源于记录链接，包括人口普查数据匹配，也是姓名匹配的常用算法（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaro%E2%80%93Winkler_distance\">Jaro–Winkler distance</a>），至今仍是制裁筛查商业引擎的默认基线打分函数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"levenshtein-与-token-算法-不同字段用不同工具\">Levenshtein 与 Token 算法：不同字段用不同工具</h3><p>Levenshtein 距离是串间的最少单字符编辑次数，优点是对称且满足三角不等式（因此可建索引加速），缺点是<strong>对换位不友好</strong>：&quot;Mohammed&quot; 写成 &quot;Mohamemd&quot; 需 2 次编辑而实际只是换位。改进是加入 Damerau 换位操作。它更适合<strong>长度相近的短字段</strong>（护照号、注册号）而非主名称。</p>\n<p>多词名称（&quot;Acme Global Trading Holdings Ltd&quot;）用整串编辑距离会因多一个词被严重惩罚。Token 类方法先切词再比集合：Jaccard、token sort ratio、token set ratio。其中 token set ratio 对交集与差集分别比较，能正确处理 &quot;Acme Trading Ltd&quot; 与 &quot;Acme Global Trading Ltd&quot; 这类包含关系，在公司名匹配上表现最好。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>擅长</th>\n<th>弱项</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Jaro-Winkler</td>\n<td>短名字、前缀相同的变体</td>\n<td>词序、多余词</td>\n<td>个人姓名主打分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Levenshtein / Damerau</td>\n<td>长度相近的串、可建索引</td>\n<td>多词、换位（基础版）</td>\n<td>证件号、注册号校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token set / Jaccard</td>\n<td>多词公司名、包含关系</td>\n<td>单词内拼写错误</td>\n<td>实体名称打分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语音编码</td>\n<td>发音近似的拼写差异</td>\n<td>发音相近的无关名字</td>\n<td>候选集生成，不直接判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多字段融合与打分\">多字段融合与打分</h2><p>只比名称是误报的主要来源。一个名字匹配度高但国籍、出生日期、行业全都不符的候选，与一个名字匹配度中等但生日与国籍完全一致的候选，前者几乎肯定是误报，后者几乎肯定是真命中。字段权重应当反映<strong>区分度</strong>：出生日期几乎唯一因而权重最高；名称是必须字段但噪声大；地址在实体筛查里权重较高（因为实体清单可以只列地址）；国籍与性别是辅助信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"加权融合与两个关键机制\">加权融合与两个关键机制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def composite_score(customer, candidate, profile):&#10;    s_name = max(&#10;        jaro_winkler(customer.name, candidate.name),&#10;        token_set_ratio(customer.name, candidate.name),&#10;        max_phonetic_score(customer.name, candidate.aliases),&#10;    )&#10;    s_dob = dob_match(customer.dob, candidate.dob)          # 1.0 exact / 0.5 same year / 0.0 conflict&#10;    s_nat = 1.0 if customer.nationality == candidate.nationality else 0.0&#10;    s_addr = address_overlap(customer.addresses, candidate.addresses)&#10;&#10;    if s_name &lt; profile.name_floor:&#10;        return 0.0                                          # 名称不达标直接淘汰&#10;&#10;    total = (s_name * profile.w_name&#10;             + s_dob * profile.w_dob&#10;             + s_nat * profile.w_nat&#10;             + s_addr * profile.w_addr)&#10;&#10;    if dob_conflict(customer.dob, candidate.dob):&#10;        total *= profile.conflict_penalty                  # 生日冲突的强降权&#10;    return total\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> composite_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(customer, candidate, profile):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        jaro_winkler(customer.name, candidate.name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        token_set_ratio(customer.name, candidate.name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        max_phonetic_score(customer.name, candidate.aliases),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s_dob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dob_match(customer.dob, candidate.dob)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1.0 exact / 0.5 same year / 0.0 conflict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s_nat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer.nationality </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidate.nationality </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s_addr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> address_overlap(customer.addresses, candidate.addresses)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile.name_floor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                          # 名称不达标直接淘汰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile.w_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_dob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile.w_dob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_nat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile.w_nat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_addr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile.w_addr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dob_conflict(customer.dob, candidate.dob):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile.conflict_penalty                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生日冲突的强降权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个设计点决定了这个函数的行为是否可靠：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>不做的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>名称硬门槛 <code>name_floor</code></td>\n<td>名称分过低时直接淘汰</td>\n<td>生平等字段会&quot;救活&quot;名称毫不相关的候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突惩罚 <code>conflict_penalty</code></td>\n<td>生日明确冲突时主动降权</td>\n<td>只当作&quot;此项不得分&quot;，强反证被稀释掉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"别名与音译的处理位置\">别名与音译的处理位置</h3><p>别名不是&quot;多一个名字字符串&quot;，它在数据模型里有类型标签。<code>alias_type</code>（aka / fka / transliteration / spelling）与 <code>quality</code>（strong / weak）应当直接映射到打分权重：强别名命中给满分，弱别名打折（见 <a href=\"list-masterdata-version-rescreen\">名单主数据、增量版本与全量再筛查</a> 的 <code>list_alias</code> 表）。</p>\n<p>音译处理有两条实现路径。一是<strong>预生成多转写变体</strong>：对名单上的非拉丁名字，用主流转写体系（ISO 9、BGN/PCGN、ALA-LC）各生成一份拉丁形式存入别名表。二是<strong>双向归一化</strong>：把输入名与名单名都映射到中间表示再比较。前者实现简单且可审计（变体是可见的数据），后者召回更高但难以解释命中原因。合规场景优先前者，因为<strong>可解释性</strong>是审计的硬要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值标定-把召回换成成本的那笔账\">阈值标定：把召回换成成本的那笔账</h2><p>阈值不是&quot;调高一点降低误报&quot;这么简单。召回率与告警量是一条反比曲线，每一次阈值下调都产生实实在在的人力成本。这套权衡只需要一个能被算出来的工作点：拿一批已被人工判定为&quot;真命中&quot;或&quot;误报&quot;的历史候选对作标注集，在每个候选阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 上计算召回率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、精确率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与告警量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>召回率</th>\n<th>精确率</th>\n<th>每万笔告警数</th>\n<th>边际成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.70</td>\n<td>99.1%</td>\n<td>4.2%</td>\n<td>2360</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.75</td>\n<td>97.8%</td>\n<td>8.6%</td>\n<td>1140</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>94.2%</td>\n<td>18.3%</td>\n<td>515</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.85</td>\n<td>87.5%</td>\n<td>41.0%</td>\n<td>214</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.90</td>\n<td>72.3%</td>\n<td>68.5%</td>\n<td>106</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表里的数字是说明性结构（真实值取决于名单与客户画像），但形状是普遍的：从 0.70 抬到 0.80 用 4.9 个百分点的召回换掉了 78% 的告警，而从 0.85 抬到 0.90 要用 15 个百分点换一半告警。<strong>高召回区间的边际成本极低，低召回区间的边际成本极高</strong>，所以合规场景通常落在 0.75–0.85 之间。</p>\n<p>单一全局阈值是最差的设计。正确做法是按<strong>风险上下文</strong>分层，让总告警量不变而重要场景的召回上升：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分层维度</th>\n<th>低阈值（更敏感）</th>\n<th>高阈值（更宽松）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户风险等级</td>\n<td>高风险（见 <a href=\"../screening-lifecycle-integration/customer-risk-rating-edd\">客户风险分级</a>）</td>\n<td>低风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>名单类型</td>\n<td>SDN 等冻结类</td>\n<td>PEP / 不利信息等信号类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易金额</td>\n<td>大额交易</td>\n<td>小额交易</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按这三层组合取阈值，比调整单一全局阈值划算得多——它把人力从低价值告警转移到高价值告警上。</p>\n<p>阈值一旦审定就应当冻结为&quot;阈值配置版本&quot;，因为它需要出现在判定记录里（见 <a href=\"list-masterdata-version-rescreen\">名单主数据、增量版本与全量再筛查</a> 的 <code>threshold_profile</code>）。但<strong>标注集本身会漂移</strong>：名单构成变了、客户画像变了、业务拓展到新国家了，原来的工作点就未必最优。</p>\n<p>实务节奏是<strong>季度或半年度再标定</strong>，并遵守两条纪律：一是再标定必须有新标注样本支撑，不能凭感觉调；二是阈值变更必须走变更评审并记录版本，因为调高阈值意味着<strong>主动放弃了那部分召回</strong>——这在监管眼里是一个需要解释的决策。误报治理的具体手段（白名单、名单质量反馈）见 <a href=\"alert-triage-falsepositive-disposition\">告警分派、误报治理与命中处置</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>主体匹配要解三类差异（文本形态、语言转写、数据缺失），必须用流水线而非单一算法：规范化 → 转写/语音编码 → 候选生成 → 相似度打分 → 多字段融合。</li>\n<li>Jaro-Winkler 适合个人姓名（前缀奖励 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sim_w = sim_j + \\ell p(1-sim_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell \\le 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 标准值 0.1 且不超过 0.25）；Levenshtein 适合短证件号；Token set 适合多词公司名；语音编码只用于生成候选集。</li>\n<li>只比名称是误报主因，多字段加权融合时名称应有硬门槛，生日冲突应是主动降权而非仅不得分。</li>\n<li>别名必须带类型与质量标签并映射到打分权重；音译优先用预生成变体而非隐式归一化，因为可解释性是审计硬要求。</li>\n<li>阈值标定的核心是&quot;每提升 1% 召回要付出多少告警人力&quot;，高召回区间边际成本低、低召回区间极高，合规场景通常落在 0.75–0.85。</li>\n<li>分层阈值（按客户风险、名单类型、交易金额）能在告警总量不变时提高关键场景召回；阈值配置必须版本化并季度再标定，调高即意味着主动放弃召回。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模糊匹配、音译与别名算法与阈值","id":"模糊匹配-音译与别名算法与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：匹配问题的三个层次","id":"核心概念-匹配问题的三个层次"},{"level":3,"text":"规范化：确定性消歧","id":"规范化-确定性消歧"},{"level":2,"text":"相似度算法：各自解决什么","id":"相似度算法-各自解决什么"},{"level":3,"text":"Jaro-Winkler：前缀加权的编辑距离","id":"jaro-winkler-前缀加权的编辑距离"},{"level":3,"text":"Levenshtein 与 Token 算法：不同字段用不同工具","id":"levenshtein-与-token-算法-不同字段用不同工具"},{"level":2,"text":"多字段融合与打分","id":"多字段融合与打分"},{"level":3,"text":"加权融合与两个关键机制","id":"加权融合与两个关键机制"},{"level":3,"text":"别名与音译的处理位置","id":"别名与音译的处理位置"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值标定：把召回换成成本的那笔账","id":"阈值标定-把召回换成成本的那笔账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"名单主数据、增量版本与全量再筛查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/party-sanctions-screening-aml/screening-engine/list-masterdata-version-rescreen"},"next":{"title":"告警分派、误报治理与命中处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/party-sanctions-screening-aml/screening-engine/alert-triage-falsepositive-disposition"}}